<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" name="viewport"/>
<meta content="Ahmed Sharif — mechanical engineering, robotics, and embedded systems portfolio." name="description"/>
<title>Ahmed Sharif — Engineering Portfolio</title>
<style>
:root {
  --ink:#111318; --paper:#f5f4ef; --panel:#eceae3; --white:#fff;
  --muted:#646872; --line:rgba(17,19,24,.14); --accent:#5b5ce2; --accent2:#9c6cff;
  --dark:#101116; --dark2:#181a22; --radius:28px; --shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(20,22,35,.12);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;background:var(--paper)}
body{margin:0;color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;line-height:1.5;overflow-x:hidden}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
button,video,a{-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
img,video{display:block;max-width:100%}
::selection{background:#17191f;color:#fff}
#progress{position:fixed;left:0;top:0;height:3px;width:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));z-index:999}
.cursor-glow{position:fixed;pointer-events:none;width:38rem;height:38rem;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(91,92,226,.09),transparent 64%);transform:translate(-50%,-50%);z-index:0;opacity:.85}
.shell{width:min(1240px,calc(100% - 48px));margin-inline:auto;position:relative;z-index:1}
.nav-wrap{position:fixed;top:18px;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;padding:0 18px}
.nav{width:min(1180px,100%);margin:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:12px 14px 12px 18px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.62);background:rgba(247,246,241,.78);backdrop-filter:blur(22px) saturate(150%);border-radius:999px;box-shadow:0 14px 45px rgba(32,34,48,.08)}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.brand-dot{width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(91,92,226,.10)}
.nav-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.nav-links a{padding:9px 13px;border-radius:999px;color:#4e5159;font-size:.92rem;font-weight:650;transition:.2s ease}
.nav-links a:hover{background:#fff;color:#111}
.nav-cta{background:var(--dark)!important;color:#fff!important;padding-inline:16px!important}
.hero{min-height:100svh;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:54px;align-items:center;padding:145px 0 90px}
.kicker{font-size:.78rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.16em;font-weight:800;color:#6f7280;margin:0 0 18px}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(4.4rem,8.2vw,8.4rem);line-height:.87;letter-spacing:-.075em;margin:0;max-width:8.8ch;font-weight:760}
.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1.5px #353943}
.hero-copy>p:not(.kicker){font-size:clamp(1.05rem,1.5vw,1.25rem);color:var(--muted);max-width:640px;margin:28px 0 0}
.hero-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:34px}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:14px 19px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:750;border:1px solid var(--line);transition:.23s ease;cursor:pointer}
.btn.primary{background:var(--dark);color:#fff;border-color:var(--dark);box-shadow:0 14px 30px rgba(16,17,22,.14)}
.btn.secondary{background:rgba(255,255,255,.5)}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 16px 34px rgba(16,17,22,.12)}
.hero-art{position:relative;min-height:610px}
.hero-frame{position:absolute;border-radius:30px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow);border:8px solid rgba(255,255,255,.84);background:#d8d5cc;transform-origin:center;transition:transform .5s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}
.hero-frame img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.hero-frame.one{width:68%;aspect-ratio:4/3;right:0;top:5%;transform:rotate(5deg)}
.hero-frame.two{width:50%;aspect-ratio:3/4;left:0;top:17%;transform:rotate(-7deg)}
.hero-frame.three{width:55%;aspect-ratio:16/10;right:9%;bottom:4%;transform:rotate(-2deg)}
.hero-art:hover .one{transform:rotate(2deg) translateY(-8px)}
.hero-art:hover .two{transform:rotate(-3deg) translate(-5px,-4px)}
.hero-art:hover .three{transform:rotate(2deg) translate(6px,-8px)}
.status-pill{position:absolute;z-index:5;right:4%;bottom:22%;padding:12px 15px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 16px 45px rgba(20,22,35,.14);font-size:.82rem;font-weight:780;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.status-pill i{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#29bf7f;box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(41,191,127,.12)}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:126px}
.stat{padding:28px 18px 28px 0}
.stat strong{display:block;font-size:2rem;letter-spacing:-.05em}
.stat span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem}
.section-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:36px;margin-bottom:38px}
.section-head h2{font-size:clamp(3.2rem,6vw,6.3rem);line-height:.93;letter-spacing:-.065em;margin:0;max-width:9ch}
.section-head p{max-width:470px;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.02rem;margin:0}
.work{padding:0 0 128px}
.work-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr);gap:22px}
.project-card{grid-column:span 6;background:#fff;border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(17,19,24,.08);box-shadow:0 14px 44px rgba(26,28,38,.05);transition:transform .35s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),box-shadow .35s ease}
.project-card.span-7{grid-column:span 7}
.project-card.span-5{grid-column:span 5}
.project-card.span-12{grid-column:1/-1}
.project-card:hover{transform:translateY(-7px);box-shadow:0 28px 60px rgba(26,28,38,.1)}
.project-media{position:relative;background:#16171d;aspect-ratio:16/10;overflow:hidden}
.project-card[data-project="smart-safe"] .project-media{aspect-ratio:16/12}
.project-video{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;background:#0d0e12}
.project-video::-webkit-media-controls-panel{background:linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(0,0,0,.72))}
.media-badge{position:absolute;left:16px;top:16px;background:rgba(15,16,20,.72);color:#fff;padding:8px 11px;border-radius:999px;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.11em;backdrop-filter:blur(10px);pointer-events:none}
.project-copy{padding:26px 28px 30px}
.project-type{font-size:.76rem!important;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:820;color:#7a7e88!important;margin:0 0 12px!important}
.project-copy h3{font-size:clamp(2rem,3vw,3.6rem);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:0 0 14px}
.project-copy>p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.98rem;max-width:700px;margin:0}
.tag-row{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:20px 0 22px}
.tag-row span{font-size:.74rem;font-weight:700;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#f2f1ec;color:#565963}
.text-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:800;border-bottom:1px solid #181a20;padding-bottom:3px}
.text-link span{transition:transform .2s ease}
.text-link:hover span{transform:translate(3px,-3px)}
.horizontal{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr}
.horizontal .project-media{aspect-ratio:auto;min-height:470px}
.horizontal .project-copy{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:42px}
.build-section{padding:126px 0;background:var(--dark);color:#fff;position:relative;z-index:1}
.build-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:80px;align-items:start}
.build-grid h2{font-size:clamp(3.4rem,6vw,6.5rem);line-height:.92;letter-spacing:-.065em;margin:0 0 24px}
.build-grid>div:first-child>p{color:#a9adb7;max-width:500px}
.steps{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15)}
.step{display:grid;grid-template-columns:70px 1fr;gap:20px;padding:30px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);transition:.25s ease}
.step:hover{padding-left:14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,.03),transparent)}
.step-num{color:#777d89;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em}
.step h3{font-size:1.5rem;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:0 0 8px}
.step p{color:#a9adb7;margin:0}
.about{padding:130px 0}
.about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:86px;align-items:start}
.about h2{font-size:clamp(3.6rem,7vw,7rem);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.07em;margin:0}
.about-copy{font-size:1.13rem;color:var(--muted)}
.about-copy p:first-child{color:var(--ink);font-size:1.5rem;letter-spacing:-.025em}
.tool-list{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:30px}
.tool-list span{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px 13px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem}
.contact{padding:85px 0 110px}
.contact-card{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5b5ce2,#8359e8 52%,#9b6cff);color:#fff;border-radius:38px;padding:clamp(36px,7vw,80px);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.contact-card:after{content:"";position:absolute;width:420px;height:420px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);border-radius:50%;right:-120px;top:-170px;box-shadow:0 0 0 60px rgba(255,255,255,.04),0 0 0 120px rgba(255,255,255,.025)}
.contact-card h2{font-size:clamp(3.5rem,7vw,7rem);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.065em;margin:0 0 28px;max-width:10ch;position:relative;z-index:1}
.contact-card p{max-width:620px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.82);position:relative;z-index:1}
.contact-card .btn{position:relative;z-index:2;background:#fff;color:#17191f;border:0;margin-top:14px}
footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:24px 0 40px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.84rem}
.case-modal{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:500;visibility:hidden;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:.25s ease}
.case-modal:target{visibility:visible;opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
.case-backdrop{position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(7,8,12,.72);backdrop-filter:blur(10px)}
.case-sheet{position:absolute;right:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:min(980px,95vw);background:#f6f5f0;overflow:auto;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .45s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);box-shadow:-30px 0 90px rgba(0,0,0,.24)}
.case-modal:target .case-sheet{transform:translateX(0)}
.case-topbar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:17px 26px;background:rgba(246,245,240,.86);backdrop-filter:blur(18px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.case-topbar p{margin:0;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#777b84}
.close-case{width:42px;height:42px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;background:#17191f;color:#fff;font-size:1.6rem;line-height:1}
.case-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .85fr;gap:38px;padding:55px 44px 40px;align-items:center}
.case-hero h2{font-size:clamp(4rem,8vw,7.5rem);line-height:.86;letter-spacing:-.075em;margin:0 0 26px}
.case-lede{font-size:1.12rem;color:var(--muted)}
.case-hero img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;border-radius:25px;transform:rotate(2deg);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.tag-row.light span{background:#e9e7df}
.case-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;padding:0 44px 70px}
.case-grid>div{padding:28px;border-radius:22px;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(17,19,24,.07)}
.case-grid p{color:var(--muted)}
.case-grid .case-built{grid-column:1/-1}
.mini-label{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:.72rem!important;font-weight:850;color:#666b75!important;margin-top:0}
.case-built ol{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:20px 0 0;counter-reset:item}
.case-built li{counter-increment:item;padding:16px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;grid-template-columns:50px 1fr;gap:15px}
.case-built li:before{content:"0" counter(item);color:#888d96;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:800}
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}
.reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}
@media(max-width:980px){
  .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-top:135px;gap:25px} .hero h1{max-width:10ch} .hero-art{min-height:520px}
  .stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)} .section-head{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}
  .work-grid{gap:16px} .project-card.span-7,.project-card.span-5{grid-column:1/-1} .horizontal{display:block}
  .build-grid,.about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:42px} .case-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr} .case-hero img{aspect-ratio:16/10;transform:none}
}
@media(max-width:720px){
  .shell{width:min(100% - 28px,1240px)} .nav-wrap{top:10px;padding:0 9px} .nav{padding:10px 11px 10px 14px} .nav-links a:not(.nav-cta){display:none}
  .hero{min-height:auto;padding:120px 0 70px} .hero h1{font-size:clamp(3.7rem,16vw,6rem)} .hero-art{min-height:390px}
  .hero-frame.one{width:70%} .hero-frame.two{width:48%} .hero-frame.three{width:58%} .status-pill{bottom:14%}
  .stats{margin-bottom:85px} .section-head h2{font-size:3.7rem} .work{padding-bottom:90px}
  .project-copy{padding:22px} .horizontal .project-media{min-height:0;aspect-ratio:16/10} .horizontal .project-copy{padding:24px}
  .build-section,.about{padding:90px 0} .case-sheet{width:100vw} .case-hero{padding:36px 20px 28px} .case-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:0 20px 50px} .case-grid .case-built{grid-column:auto}
  .contact-card{border-radius:28px} footer{flex-direction:column}
}
</style>

&lt;!-- All project photos and videos are embedded directly in this HTML file. No external media paths are required. --&gt;

<style id="dark-theme-polish">
:root{
  --ink:#f5f7fb;
  --paper:#090a0f;
  --panel:#11131a;
  --white:#151822;
  --muted:#9aa3b2;
  --line:rgba(255,255,255,.10);
  --accent:#7c6cff;
  --accent2:#43d3ff;
  --dark:#f7f8fb;
  --dark2:#11131a;
  --shadow:0 28px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.38);
}
html{background:#090a0f}
body{
  color:var(--ink);
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 78% 7%, rgba(124,108,255,.16), transparent 28rem),
    radial-gradient(circle at 8% 38%, rgba(67,211,255,.07), transparent 26rem),
    linear-gradient(180deg,#0a0b10 0%,#090a0f 48%,#0b0c12 100%);
  min-height:100vh;
}
body:before{
  content:"";
  position:fixed;
  inset:0;
  pointer-events:none;
  z-index:0;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.018),transparent 22%,transparent 78%,rgba(255,255,255,.012));
}
::selection{background:#7c6cff;color:#fff}
#progress{height:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#7c6cff,#43d3ff)}
.cursor-glow{background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(124,108,255,.13),transparent 64%);opacity:.68}
.nav{
  border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.12);
  background:rgba(14,16,23,.76);
  box-shadow:0 18px 55px rgba(0,0,0,.28), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.04);
}
.brand{color:#fff}
.brand-dot{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7c6cff,#43d3ff);box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(124,108,255,.12),0 0 26px rgba(124,108,255,.30)}
.nav-links a{color:#a6adba}
.nav-links a:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);color:#fff}
.nav-cta{background:#f5f7fb!important;color:#0c0d12!important;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(255,255,255,.08)}
.kicker{color:#858e9e}
.hero h1{color:#f7f8fb;text-shadow:0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.24)}
.hero h1 em{-webkit-text-stroke:1.35px #71798a;color:transparent}
.hero-copy>p:not(.kicker){color:#a2a9b6}
.btn{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.12)}
.btn.primary{background:#f5f7fb;color:#0c0d12;border-color:#f5f7fb;box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(255,255,255,.08)}
.btn.secondary{background:rgba(255,255,255,.045);color:#f4f6fa}
.btn.secondary:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.075);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.18)}
.btn:hover{box-shadow:0 18px 42px rgba(0,0,0,.24)}
.hero-frame{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.10);background:#11131a;box-shadow:0 28px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.42),0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.04)}
.status-pill{background:rgba(18,20,28,.90);color:#f7f8fb;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);box-shadow:0 16px 45px rgba(0,0,0,.30);backdrop-filter:blur(16px)}
.status-pill i{background:#46d995;box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(70,217,149,.10),0 0 18px rgba(70,217,149,.32)}
.stats{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.10)}
.stat strong{color:#f7f8fb}
.stat span,.section-head p{color:#949cab}
.section-head h2{color:#f7f8fb}
.project-card{
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(22,25,34,.96),rgba(15,17,24,.98));
  border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.075);
  box-shadow:0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,.24),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.025);
}
.project-card:hover{
  box-shadow:0 30px 75px rgba(0,0,0,.38),0 0 0 1px rgba(124,108,255,.16);
  border-color:rgba(124,108,255,.22);
}
.project-media{background:#05060a}
.project-video{background:#05060a}
.media-badge{background:rgba(8,9,13,.72);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);box-shadow:0 8px 26px rgba(0,0,0,.24)}
.project-type{color:#7e8797!important}
.project-copy h3{color:#f7f8fb}
.project-copy>p{color:#9ba3b1}
.tag-row span{background:rgba(255,255,255,.055);color:#b9c0cb;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06)}
.text-link{color:#f6f7fa;border-color:#596171}
.build-section{
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 18% 0%,rgba(124,108,255,.13),transparent 28rem),
    linear-gradient(180deg,#10121a,#0d0f15);
  border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
}
.build-grid>div:first-child>p,.step p{color:#99a2b0}
.steps,.step{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.10)}
.step:hover{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(124,108,255,.07),transparent)}
.step-num{color:#697386}.step h3{color:#f5f7fb}
.about h2{color:#f7f8fb}
.about-copy{color:#9ba4b2}.about-copy p:first-child{color:#f3f5f9}
.tool-list span{background:#12151d;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.09);color:#d1d6df;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.025)}
.contact-card{
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 92% 8%,rgba(67,211,255,.23),transparent 28rem),
    linear-gradient(135deg,#5e52dd 0%,#7556e8 48%,#6347ce 100%);
  box-shadow:0 30px 90px rgba(35,24,95,.35),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.10);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10)
}
.contact-card .btn{background:#fff;color:#101117}
footer{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.09);color:#7f8897}
.case-backdrop{background:rgba(3,4,8,.82)}
.case-sheet{background:#0d0f15;color:#f5f7fb;box-shadow:-30px 0 100px rgba(0,0,0,.55)}
.case-topbar{background:rgba(13,15,21,.84);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.09)}
.case-topbar p{color:#818a98}.close-case{background:#f5f7fb;color:#0d0f15}
.case-lede{color:#99a2b0}.case-hero img{box-shadow:0 28px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.40)}
.tag-row.light span{background:rgba(255,255,255,.06)}
.case-grid>div{background:#13161f;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.07);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.02)}
.case-grid p{color:#98a1af}.mini-label{color:#7d8796!important}
.case-built li{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.09)}
.case-built li:before{color:#6f7989}
::-webkit-scrollbar{width:12px}
::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:#090a0f}
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:#252936;border:3px solid #090a0f;border-radius:999px}
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover{background:#343949}
@media(max-width:720px){
  .nav{background:rgba(13,15,21,.88)}
}
</style>

</head>
<body>
<div id="progress"></div><div class="cursor-glow" id="glow"></div>
<header class="nav-wrap">
<nav aria-label="Main navigation" class="nav">
<a class="brand" href="#top"><span class="brand-dot"></span>Ahmed Sharif</a>
<div class="nav-links"><a href="#work">Work</a><a href="#about">About</a><a class="nav-cta" href="#contact">Contact ↗</a></div>
</nav>
</header>
<main id="top">
<section class="hero shell">
<div class="hero-copy reveal">
<p class="kicker">Mechanical engineering · robotics · learning by building</p>
<h1>I turn ideas into <em>working physical systems.</em></h1>
<p>I’m Ahmed Sharif, a mechanical engineering student at Yale interested in robotics, mechanical design, embedded systems, and data-driven engineering. I build hands-on projects to strengthen my technical foundation and learn how sensing, control, software, and physical mechanisms come together in real systems.</p>
